2
00:03:45,350 --> 00:03:49,200
手を合わせて見つめるだけで
Just by putting our hands together and gazing,

3
00:03:50,500 --> 00:03:54,800
愛し合える話もできる
we can even talk about loving each other.

4
00:03:56,800 --> 00:04:00,800
くちづけするより長くて
Longer than a kiss,

5
00:04:01,000 --> 00:04:06,800
輝き聴くように強く 私の心を揺さぶるあなた
stronger, like listening to a radiance, you shake my heart.

6
00:04:09,000 --> 00:04:13,000
ものはいまづみ思っただけで
Just thinking about things right now,

7
00:04:14,200 --> 00:04:19,000
すぐあなたにわかってしまう
you understand right away.

8
00:04:21,000 --> 00:04:26,000
眠りたくなったらベッド
When you want to sleep, to bed—

9
00:04:27,000 --> 00:04:31,000
次から次へとおしゃべりなあなた
you, chatting endlessly from one thing to the next.

10
00:04:33,000 --> 00:04:38,000
信じられないことばかりあるの
There are so many unbelievable things.

11
00:04:38,500 --> 00:04:44,200
もしかならもしもだからそんなの頭
If it's a what-if, then something like that...

12
00:04:45,000 --> 00:04:52,000
それでもいいわ 近づく少し地球の男に
Even so, it's fine, getting a little closer to Earth men...

13
00:04:53,500 --> 00:04:57,500
飽きたところよ ああ！
I'm getting tired of it, ah!

14
00:05:08,108 --> 00:05:08,808
UFO!

15
00:05:15,158 --> 00:05:17,808
古びた伝説は 呪われた幽霊船に
The ancient legend leads to a cursed ghost ship,

16
00:05:17,808 --> 00:05:20,008
続く夜の潮汐
continuing on the night's tide.

17
00:05:20,208 --> 00:05:23,808
そこに富が残る 海賊の夢があるのなら
If there's wealth and pirate dreams left behind there,

18
00:05:23,958 --> 00:05:25,908
頂くしかないでしょ？
we have no choice but to claim it, right?

19
00:05:26,408 --> 00:05:28,008
「無謀な赤よ 若き盗人よ」
"You reckless red, you young thief,"

20
00:05:28,158 --> 00:05:30,308
「命をもって 後悔に代えさせてやろう」
"let's pay for regret with your life."

21
00:05:30,508 --> 00:05:32,808
止まない雨の弾丸で
With the endless rain of bullets,

22
00:05:32,808 --> 00:05:36,508
(走る鼓動 まだこの脚走れるはず)
(A running heartbeat, my legs should still be able to run)

23
00:05:38,208 --> 00:05:41,808
美しいほど この瞳焦がす 生命の炎
Burning so brightly it scorches these eyes, the flame of life,

24
00:05:41,808 --> 00:05:44,208
ガーネットの色彩
the colors of garnet.

25
00:05:44,408 --> 00:05:48,508
掬う 宝石なのだなら
If you are scooping up jewels,

26
00:05:48,708 --> 00:05:50,108
(ガーネットの色彩 貴方にはない)
(The colors of garnet, which you don't have)

27
00:05:50,158 --> 00:05:53,808
私のもの そう私のもの 奪ってみろ
My property, yes, my property, try and steal it.

28
00:05:53,808 --> 00:05:56,108
命の証を 貴方の求める全てを
The proof of life, everything you desire.

29
00:05:56,108 --> 00:05:59,408
輝きはくすんで 錆びついていて
Its radiance dulls, rusting away,

30
00:05:59,408 --> 00:06:03,008
それでも 泥舟にしがみつくなら
even so, if you cling to a sinking ship,

31
00:06:03,008 --> 00:06:04,608
泡沫と共に沈め
sink along with the foam.

32
00:06:04,608 --> 00:06:08,008
黒い帆に 隠れる極上の海賊の秘宝 掴んで笑う
Hiding in black sails, the finest pirate treasure, grab it and laugh.

33
00:06:08,108 --> 00:06:08,908
UFO!

34
00:06:08,908 --> 00:06:13,508
満月の金銀珠玉 七つの海の宝珠に「集る虫ども」
To the gold, silver, pearls, and jewels of the full moon, to the seven seas' precious gems, "gathering insects,"

35
00:06:13,508 --> 00:06:17,008
こそり富を狙う 愚か者に思い知らせる 相応しい持ち主を
let the fools sneaking around for wealth know who the rightful owner is.

36
00:06:17,008 --> 00:06:21,008
船に宿る黒い魂の群れ 影の底で忍び寄る絶望の渦 まさか蓋の閉じた箱
A swarm of dark souls dwelling in the ship, a vortex of despair creeping from the bottom of shadows, just like a closed box.

37
00:06:21,008 --> 00:06:27,008
手放しちゃえば 諦めちゃえば 悪夢の中から逃げられるのに まだ掴んでる 欲望が重いから
If you let go, if you give up, you could escape from the nightmare, but you're still grasping it because your desire is heavy.

38
00:06:27,008 --> 00:06:29,808
(逃げられるのに まだ桎梏って嘆く？)
(You can escape, yet you still lament being shackled?)

39
00:06:33,508 --> 00:06:37,808
自分自身を信じ込ませて 縛って縛り付けてて気付いた 呪いの出口 永久の夜の海域
Believing in oneself, tied down, bound tight, realizing it: the exit of the curse, the eternal night sea area.

40
00:06:37,808 --> 00:06:40,008
目を覚まして 貴方の悪夢から 連れ出す霊舟よ 出航して
Wake up, take me out of your nightmare, ghost ship, set sail!

